@*
    The foot of every screen that plays music, under the play bar: on its left what this one is (an exercise's key and variation
    on its card with Change, a piece's bars, a drill's target and set), on its right the way on (the next exercise, Finish
    practice with the session's clocks, a routine's time, Skip and Next). Full screen takes it away. The owner, 28 November 2026:
    "going to the next exercises, which I don't want at the top, I want at the bottom".
*@
<footer class="play-foot full-hide" aria-label="@Label">
    <div class="play-foot-what">@What</div>
    <div class="play-foot-on">@WayOn</div>
</footer>

@code {
    /// <summary>What this one is.</summary>
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? What { get; set; }

    /// <summary>The way on.</summary>
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? WayOn { get; set; }

    [Parameter] public string Label { get; set; } = "What and what next";
}
